Subject: [PATCH 14/15] =?UTF-8?q?=E7=B5=B1=E5=90=88:=20=E5=8F=B3=E3=82=AF?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E3=83=AA=E3=83=83=E3=82=AF=E7=9B=B8=E5=BD=93=E3=81=AE=E3=83=91?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E3=83=83=E3=83=89=E3=83=9C=E3=82=BF=E3=83=B3=E3=82=92=E8=BF=BD?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=8A=A0?=
